WEBVTT

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:32.115
This footage is from 5:00 am today.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:35.243
It should be within visual
distance in another six hours.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:36.870
Any word from our team?

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.582
Yes, Sir. Earlier, the nen'i
operator of the 17th Platoon

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:43.251
detected an unidentified life form.

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:47.047
The 17th? Felli...

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:51.760
D3. The bioactivity was in this area.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.927
The survivors?

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:56.556
Unknown. Upon approach,
there was too much interference.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.934
Hmph! Their nen'i operator
can't even know <i>that</i>?

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.102
Shante.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:03.188
A ruined city without a single corpse

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:07.067
and now an unknown
life form, huh? It's a mystery...

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.944
If the nen'i operator can't confirm it,

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:11.738
our only choice is to investigate.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.740
Agreed. Sharnid, get things--

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.617
Please wait.

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.702
When dealing with an unknown entity,

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:20.163
the direct approach is too dangerous.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.081
But...

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.749
I think it would be better
to have our nen'i operator

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.794
search a few more times.

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:29.255
It's possible that the life
form is a mutated contaminoid.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.550
Hmph! If that's the case,
I'll friggin' take care of it myself!

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.885
There's no way that you could.

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.804
What?!

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:37.430
Layfon...

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:43.269
I agree with Gorneo's opinion.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.232
We move out in sixty minutes.
Hurry with your preparations.

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:50.610
Nina!

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:52.696
You all right with this?

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:54.531
With what?

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:04.874
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:08.503
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:02:08.503 --> 00:02:16.219
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.808
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:25.103
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:31.901
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:34.904
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:38.450
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:45.165
<i>I don't believe anything I</i>
<i>can obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:51.379
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:58.636
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:03.224
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:06.770
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:12.609
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:03:12.609 --> 00:03:16.363
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:03:16.363 --> 00:03:19.949
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.451
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:03:21.451 --> 00:03:26.706
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:03:42.097 --> 00:03:44.015
Gently, please.

00:03:44.015 --> 00:03:45.600
Ma'am.

00:03:51.773 --> 00:03:54.109
Gor! Let's go down there, too!

00:03:54.109 --> 00:03:57.529
Shante... No matter what,
make no moves against him.

00:03:57.529 --> 00:03:58.530
Why not?

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:01.866
Because it's got nothing to do with you.

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:04.536
Then smile!

00:04:04.536 --> 00:04:05.495
Gor!

00:04:05.495 --> 00:04:06.788
Get on.

00:04:06.788 --> 00:04:08.415
Okay.

00:04:21.553 --> 00:04:25.140
"Lueckens's Revenge"

00:04:27.058 --> 00:04:29.853
That's a user of Tempered Kei for you.

00:04:29.853 --> 00:04:31.688
Let's go.

00:04:34.024 --> 00:04:35.942
You took your time, huh?

00:04:36.359 --> 00:04:39.904
And the view's terrible from down there.

00:04:42.866 --> 00:04:44.200
Any bioactivity?

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:50.081
None. More importantly, Fon-Fon...
Would you crouch slightly, please?

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:51.166
Why?

00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:54.210
Just do it now!

00:04:55.712 --> 00:04:59.007
What is this about?
We're getting farther and farther behind.

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:01.259
Do not jostle me so much.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:02.469
Then just please get down.

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:05.472
I will fall! Hold on tightly.

00:05:05.472 --> 00:05:09.100
"Hold on," she says...

00:05:14.439 --> 00:05:17.734
Grasping the tips of my feet
is meaningless, is it not?

00:05:17.734 --> 00:05:22.405
Uh, well, I have my reasons...

00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:26.701
Namely that you are
most imprudent, if not unclean.

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.495
Please rid yourself of such thoughts.

00:05:28.495 --> 00:05:33.416
If you understand,
then please don't get on top of me.

00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:35.043
Ow!

00:05:35.418 --> 00:05:37.128
You are an idiot.

00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:40.590
Please, don't be violent up there!

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:44.094
I will try as best I'm able.

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.515
Have you spoken since then?

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.850
With our platoon leader.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.435
No.

00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:56.523
It can't be helped. It's all the truth.

00:05:56.523 --> 00:05:59.567
Competing in underground tournaments...

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:05.240
Hurting people... Being expelled
from the Heaven's Blades...

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:08.201
Was there no other way?

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:15.750
Well... There may have been.
But back then, I was desperate...

00:06:16.126 --> 00:06:17.961
...to live.

00:06:22.549 --> 00:06:26.720
That's irrefutable proof you've
been in the underground tournaments.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.596
And there's more.

00:06:28.596 --> 00:06:32.017
If that came to light,
you'd forfeit your Heaven's Blade.

00:06:32.017 --> 00:06:35.353
Your credibility would come crashing down.

00:06:35.353 --> 00:06:37.230
In which case,

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:43.111
wouldn't it be best to lose
your sword but keep your honor intact?

00:06:43.945 --> 00:06:47.365
Tomorrow is the Heaven's Blade
qualifying match.

00:06:47.365 --> 00:06:49.784
Depending on your actions,

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:52.996
I could make those photos disappear.

00:06:53.538 --> 00:06:57.709
You know what I'm saying, don't you?

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.053
Layfon! What's wrong?

00:07:08.053 --> 00:07:12.515
Oh... I couldn't sleep.

00:07:13.058 --> 00:07:14.434
Want some?

00:07:14.434 --> 00:07:16.269
Thank you.

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:20.815
Tomorrow... Will you be all right?

00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:26.363
I... I feel uneasy for some reason.

00:07:28.031 --> 00:07:29.657
Watch.

00:07:32.035 --> 00:07:36.539
Just like that! That's how fast I'll finish it.

00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:38.166
Layfon...

00:07:49.594 --> 00:07:52.472
It looks like he's gotten much better.

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:54.099
Shinora-<i>san</i>...

00:07:54.099 --> 00:07:56.017
It was quite traumatic, wasn't it?

00:07:56.017 --> 00:07:59.312
He was attacked by someone
possessed by a contaminoid, yes?

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:01.272
What a surprise that was.

00:08:01.272 --> 00:08:04.818
Yes. But I...

00:08:04.818 --> 00:08:07.654
I don't remember it very well.

00:08:08.863 --> 00:08:11.866
Aaah, but I'm so glad!

00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:16.621
Glad not to have lost this chest!

00:08:18.748 --> 00:08:24.004
That creature... He was a man named "Gahard."

00:08:26.089 --> 00:08:30.510
Someone Layfon had fought before.

00:08:43.273 --> 00:08:44.899
Layfon!

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:47.193
All right, begin!

00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:53.533
Here I come!

00:08:58.204 --> 00:08:59.789
Restoration.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.708
What?!

00:09:03.335 --> 00:09:04.961
Bastard!

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:23.396
Winner! Layfon Wolfstein Alseif!

00:09:24.939 --> 00:09:29.110
Close off the arena and restrain Layfon.

00:09:30.111 --> 00:09:31.446
What happened?

00:09:31.446 --> 00:09:32.447
Huh? What...

00:09:32.447 --> 00:09:34.491
Scary!

00:09:34.491 --> 00:09:36.368
"Military artists and nen'i operators

00:09:36.368 --> 00:09:41.289
must never remind normal
humans that they are a threat."

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.085
That's what Her Majesty
said before I was expelled.

00:09:45.085 --> 00:09:47.671
Does Gorneo know that?

00:09:47.671 --> 00:09:51.716
He knows I was in the
underground tournaments

00:09:51.716 --> 00:09:55.845
and that I gave his senior student
Gahard wounds that will never heal.

00:09:55.845 --> 00:09:57.514
That's all.

00:09:57.514 --> 00:10:00.767
He probably wouldn't make
the effort to know anything else.

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:01.768
Ow!

00:10:01.768 --> 00:10:03.812
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:10:03.812 --> 00:10:06.314
Please don't get violent!

00:10:06.731 --> 00:10:10.068
Fon-Fon, you really are an idiot.

00:10:12.195 --> 00:10:14.197
Are you all right?

00:10:14.197 --> 00:10:15.990
It hurts...

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.368
Layfon! Felli! Hurry here, please.

00:10:18.368 --> 00:10:20.537
We're at point D1.

00:10:20.537 --> 00:10:22.163
Roger...

00:10:23.081 --> 00:10:24.249
This is...!

00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:28.253
I'm picking up underground readings
of what could certainly be bodies.

00:10:28.253 --> 00:10:32.549
Meaning this is the real thing?
Doesn't that take the cake?

00:10:32.549 --> 00:10:34.467
All these graves...

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.428
There's no way they could collect all the bodies

00:10:36.428 --> 00:10:40.640
and bury them-- not while
being attacked by contaminoids.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.559
Then who the heck did it?

00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:44.060
Beats me.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:47.063
I'm heading to point D3.

00:10:49.983 --> 00:10:51.526
Is something the matter?

00:10:51.526 --> 00:10:54.112
Reading bioactivity from 200 mels southwest.

00:10:54.112 --> 00:10:54.988
What?

00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:57.449
The same as I felt up above.

00:10:57.449 --> 00:10:58.450
Layfon!

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.285
Wait! Layfon!

00:11:01.119 --> 00:11:02.203
Gor!

00:11:02.203 --> 00:11:03.747
You stay here.

00:11:03.747 --> 00:11:04.456
Let's go!

00:11:04.456 --> 00:11:06.249
Wait. I'm going, too.

00:11:06.249 --> 00:11:08.084
Hey, wait!

00:11:19.721 --> 00:11:21.848
Two hundred mels to the bottom...

00:11:21.848 --> 00:11:23.892
Felli, I'm going to use the scope.

00:11:23.892 --> 00:11:25.560
Understood.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.577
Where is it?

00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:45.372
You are...

00:11:56.383 --> 00:11:58.218
What's this?!

00:12:06.726 --> 00:12:08.353
What's this?!

00:12:08.603 --> 00:12:12.440
You are a being of this realm?

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.900
My body!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.777
Then tell them...

00:12:15.777 --> 00:12:20.407
My body has fallen to dust,
no longer serving its purpose.

00:12:20.407 --> 00:12:23.034
Now but spirit, mad hatred

00:12:23.034 --> 00:12:26.788
drives me to become the fire of change.

00:12:26.788 --> 00:12:28.581
I seek a new lord

00:12:28.581 --> 00:12:33.920
that I might be renewed
and have renewed purpose.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:36.506
Come, you who desires the flame!

00:12:36.506 --> 00:12:41.886
Do so, and I shall become the blade
that sweeps aside Ignacius's filth

00:12:41.886 --> 00:12:46.266
and turn all your enemies to ash.

00:12:46.266 --> 00:12:49.477
Who... are you?

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:53.023
Tell them clearly...

00:12:55.483 --> 00:12:59.362
You have made yourself your own enemy.

00:12:59.362 --> 00:13:02.824
I am a tool, and as such I am no one.

00:13:02.824 --> 00:13:07.746
You cannot slay he who is no one.

00:13:07.746 --> 00:13:09.372
Restoration!

00:13:23.094 --> 00:13:25.305
Excellently done.

00:13:34.105 --> 00:13:36.900
Fon-Fon? Fon-Fon!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.194
Nina will be there soon, Fon-Fon.

00:13:39.778 --> 00:13:41.404
Layfon!

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.031
What happened?!

00:13:43.031 --> 00:13:44.699
You're white as a sheet.

00:13:44.699 --> 00:13:48.328
No... It's nothing.

00:13:59.464 --> 00:14:01.091
Layf--

00:14:01.549 --> 00:14:02.926
Felli? Ma'am?

00:14:02.926 --> 00:14:04.678
Felli! What is it?

00:14:04.678 --> 00:14:06.721
Sheeit, my visibility is nil.

00:14:06.721 --> 00:14:09.683
What happened? Has she been attacked?

00:14:09.683 --> 00:14:10.684
Gorneo.

00:14:10.684 --> 00:14:13.019
Where is your teammate Shante?

00:14:13.603 --> 00:14:14.688
What are you implying?

00:14:14.688 --> 00:14:16.940
I'm simply asking.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.775
Don't tell me...

00:14:20.068 --> 00:14:21.611
What the hell?!

00:14:21.611 --> 00:14:25.407
Ma'am, please return to the surface for now.

00:14:25.949 --> 00:14:30.203
The unknown life form....
And those graves we saw earlier.

00:14:30.203 --> 00:14:32.372
We still don't know anything about them.

00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:34.124
It's too dangerous to stay here.

00:14:34.124 --> 00:14:36.042
You're telling me to just abandon Felli?!

00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.669
That's not what I'm saying.

00:14:37.669 --> 00:14:41.381
But if we stay here,
it's possible that we'll all be killed.

00:14:42.674 --> 00:14:44.718
"To live," huh?

00:14:44.718 --> 00:14:47.345
I'm asking if this is to live!

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.056
Yes.

00:14:53.393 --> 00:14:56.438
Please be careful.
Even if you return to the surface,

00:14:56.438 --> 00:14:59.441
there's no guarantee you'll be safe.

00:15:00.942 --> 00:15:02.569
Layfon...

00:15:02.569 --> 00:15:05.280
Actin' all cool and shit!

00:15:07.532 --> 00:15:10.869
The faint light of a nen'i terminal...

00:15:10.869 --> 00:15:14.289
Please wait a little longer, Felli.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:23.340
This is the sernium fuel repository.

00:15:24.007 --> 00:15:27.427
It looks like the flow is still active.

00:15:30.388 --> 00:15:33.600
Sure enough, visibility is nil.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.729
Damn! How did you see that?

00:15:37.729 --> 00:15:40.565
I thought it was you.

00:15:47.197 --> 00:15:49.657
You'd better stop.

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:51.326
This is sernium.

00:15:51.326 --> 00:15:54.245
If it ignites, neither you nor
I will emerge unscathed.

00:15:54.245 --> 00:15:56.081
Shut up!

00:15:59.042 --> 00:16:01.670
You're being reckless.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:06.925
Where is Felli? Don't tell me...

00:16:06.925 --> 00:16:10.178
Hmph! She's a pain of a girl!

00:16:10.178 --> 00:16:11.638
But Gor's enemy...

00:16:11.638 --> 00:16:13.515
is you alone!

00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:16.267
I'm relieved to hear that.

00:16:32.742 --> 00:16:34.828
How can you see my attacks?

00:16:34.828 --> 00:16:36.413
If you're that obvious,

00:16:36.413 --> 00:16:39.457
it's easy to tell even in poor visibility.

00:16:39.457 --> 00:16:40.458
You sonofa--!

00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.794
Shante! Stop it!

00:16:42.794 --> 00:16:43.628
Gor...

00:16:43.628 --> 00:16:46.464
I don't want this.

00:16:46.464 --> 00:16:49.718
But... He's your enemy, right?!

00:16:49.718 --> 00:16:52.595
He messed up your senior student, right?!

00:16:52.595 --> 00:16:56.099
I don't want him <i>killed</i>.

00:16:56.725 --> 00:17:00.687
Then... smile!

00:17:01.187 --> 00:17:04.190
You hate him, right? You're angry, right?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.401
That's why you can't smile anymore, right?!

00:17:06.401 --> 00:17:11.364
Yeah. But I don't want to kill him.

00:17:11.364 --> 00:17:14.451
I want him to pay for his sins. That's all.

00:17:14.451 --> 00:17:17.829
Then what should I do?!

00:17:17.829 --> 00:17:19.664
Well, that's...

00:17:25.879 --> 00:17:28.340
Can I make it?!

00:17:36.765 --> 00:17:37.557
What was that?

00:17:37.557 --> 00:17:40.060
How would I know?

00:17:41.936 --> 00:17:44.606
<i>What do you think you're doing? Layfon...</i>

00:17:44.606 --> 00:17:46.524
Worried about him?

00:17:46.524 --> 00:17:49.736
No, not worried. Just...

00:17:49.736 --> 00:17:51.363
Angry.

00:17:51.946 --> 00:17:54.741
He's done <i>anything </i>in order to live!

00:17:54.741 --> 00:17:57.619
He sullied the military arts,
fought in underground tournaments...

00:17:57.619 --> 00:18:00.747
He's hurt people! And yet...

00:18:00.747 --> 00:18:02.165
He's an idiot.

00:18:02.165 --> 00:18:02.874
Felli!

00:18:02.874 --> 00:18:04.542
You're all right!

00:18:04.542 --> 00:18:07.712
Gorneo-<i>san </i>helped me.

00:18:07.712 --> 00:18:11.383
All things become irrelevant...

00:18:11.383 --> 00:18:18.473
...if it's to live. If the ones
important to you can live.

00:18:18.473 --> 00:18:20.308
I get it.

00:18:38.201 --> 00:18:39.828
That...

00:18:42.664 --> 00:18:45.250
What was that?

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:09.858
You used Deadly Kei Roar
to let all the heat escape, eh?

00:19:09.858 --> 00:19:11.693
I'm impressed.

00:19:12.736 --> 00:19:18.158
Gahard Barehn. I won't
let you say you've forgotten him.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.286
There's no way I could forget.

00:19:21.286 --> 00:19:23.997
I've never thought that I'd <i>like </i>to forget.

00:19:23.997 --> 00:19:29.377
But... I haven't been dwelling
on it unnecessarily either.

00:19:29.377 --> 00:19:30.670
What did you say?!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:36.509
That is all the significance
he has for me. That's what I'm saying.

00:19:36.509 --> 00:19:38.011
Bastard!

00:19:38.011 --> 00:19:41.848
So I think it's about
time to put an end to this...

00:19:41.848 --> 00:19:44.434
To your obsessive attachment to that man.

00:19:44.434 --> 00:19:46.061
Restoration!

00:19:47.729 --> 00:19:49.856
I don't care about myself.

00:19:49.856 --> 00:19:52.859
Just... spare Shante.

00:19:59.032 --> 00:20:01.368
We'll head up from the outside.

00:20:01.368 --> 00:20:06.373
As a person, I'm incomplete.
I care nothing for what happens

00:20:06.373 --> 00:20:08.041
to those who aren't important to me.

00:20:08.041 --> 00:20:11.503
Like striking down Gahard Barehn...

00:20:11.503 --> 00:20:14.673
But I think that's probably not right.

00:20:14.673 --> 00:20:17.926
So... I will not kill you.

00:20:17.926 --> 00:20:21.262
Wait! And what about my anger?!

00:20:21.262 --> 00:20:25.100
How should I have you atone for your sins?!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:29.938
It's like Shante said.
I can't help wanting to kill you!

00:20:29.938 --> 00:20:33.733
That's the only way I can
think of to release this anger!

00:20:33.733 --> 00:20:35.610
What should I...?

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.821
Do whatever you like.

00:20:38.279 --> 00:20:43.284
That's all I can say. Because
I don't know what I should do either.

00:20:44.077 --> 00:20:45.286
Here we go.

00:20:45.286 --> 00:20:49.499
We'll go straight outside.
Please prepare yourself.

00:20:52.961 --> 00:20:54.796
C'mon, hurry!

00:21:01.636 --> 00:21:03.263
Shante!

00:21:03.513 --> 00:21:06.516
Shante!!

00:21:09.728 --> 00:21:12.188
Layfon, hurry!

00:21:28.913 --> 00:21:33.043
Are you all right? Please
don't do reckless things like that.

00:21:33.043 --> 00:21:35.712
Which of us is reckless?!

00:21:35.712 --> 00:21:37.339
Layfon Alseif!

00:21:37.339 --> 00:21:38.214
Ma'am.

00:21:38.214 --> 00:21:42.385
I... I hate you.

00:21:42.385 --> 00:21:43.511
I know.

00:21:43.511 --> 00:21:44.888
No, you don't!

00:21:44.888 --> 00:21:46.264
Yes, I do.

00:21:46.264 --> 00:21:51.144
No, you don't! You... You really don't!

00:22:35.188 --> 00:22:37.941
<i>Beyond memory</i>

00:22:37.941 --> 00:22:46.324
<i>A map of the ideal future</i>
<i>you'd been searching for</i>

00:22:46.324 --> 00:22:57.377
<i>Scared of something, not</i>
<i>understanding, trembling alone</i>

00:22:57.377 --> 00:23:08.763
<i>Unable to see you, I'm</i>
<i>always wearing a fake smile</i>

00:23:08.763 --> 00:23:17.939
<i>I was held in your arms</i>

00:23:17.939 --> 00:23:23.528
<i>Fall in love like</i>
<i>you're waking up</i>

00:23:23.528 --> 00:23:28.908
<i>And then take</i>
<i>me into dreamland</i>

00:23:28.908 --> 00:23:34.664
<i>You always, you always</i>

00:23:34.664 --> 00:23:44.799
<i>You always told me tender lies</i>

00:23:53.725 --> 00:23:57.228
<i>Felli and her brother Kalian</i>
<i>visit Zuellni's resort facility.</i>

00:23:57.228 --> 00:24:00.065
<i>For some reason, the members</i>
<i>of the 17th Platoon are there.</i>

00:24:00.065 --> 00:24:04.361
<i>The plot Kalian hides behind</i>
<i>his smile will now come to light!</i>

00:24:04.361 --> 00:24:06.237
<i>Next time, "Spa Resort Kalian," and...</i>

00:24:06.237 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
